sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor D as Delivery Staff
participant DMS as DeliveryManagementSystem
participant R as r:DeliveryRequest
participant P as c:CashOnDelivery
participant N as NotificationService
actor Rc as Recipient
D->>DMS: recordPickup(r.id)
DMS->>R: recordPickup(driverId, name, now)
R->>R: check driver = assigned, ALLOCATED -> PICKED_UP
R->>R: CustodyRecord per parcel (holder = driver)
R->>N: onStatusChange(PICKED_UP)
N-->>Rc: SMS with tracking code
D->>DMS: collectCash(r.id, 20.00)
DMS->>P: recordCollection(20.00)
P-->>D: StateError - must equal quoted 25.00
D->>DMS: collectCash(r.id, 25.00)
P->>P: DUE -> PAID
D->>DMS: recordHandover(r.id, "Mei Chen")
DMS->>R: recordHandover(driverId, "Mei Chen", now)
R->>R: payment PAID? custody -> Mei Chen, PICKED_UP -> DELIVERED
R->>N: onStatusChange(DELIVERED)
N-->>Rc: SMS delivered
